@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Class diagram, part 2 of 3 (desktop client) from Student_Desktop_App/Services and the two API controllers it calls.
' Part 1 (EF Core entities) is class_diagram.puml, part 3 (server services) is class_diagram_server.puml.
' Only key members; parameters abbreviated as (..). Arrows: --> holds / injects, ..> calls or uses, *-- owns.
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 26
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam class {
  FontSize 13
  AttributeFontSize 12
}
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stereotypeFontSize 10

class LockdownCoordinator #E8F0FB {
  -_keyboard : KeyboardHookService
  -_processes : ProcessGuardService
  -_clipboard : ClipboardGuardService
  -_devices : DeviceGuardService
  -_taskManager : TaskManagerGuard?
  -_violationSink : Action<string,string>?
  +Start(window) / Stop()
  +Suspend() / Resume()
}
class ReadinessCheckService #E8F0FB {
  +RunAllAsync(req, ct)
}
class LiveMonitoringService #E8F0FB {
  -_captures : EvidenceCaptureService?
  -_webcam : WebcamMonitorService?
  +Start(token, sessionId, ..)
  +ReportViolation(reason, detail)
  +ReportEvent(type, payload, ..)
}
class WebcamMonitorService #E8F0FB {
  +Start() / Stop()
  +event IssueChanged
}
class WebcamVision #E8F0FB {
  +FaceModelFile = "face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx"
  +PhoneModelFile = "yolox_nano.onnx"
  +Analyze(frame) : VisionResult?
}
class ApiClient #E8F0FB {
  +ProbeHealthAsync(ct)
  +StartExamAsync(..)
  +StartSessionAsync(..)
  +SaveAnswerAsync(..)
  +SubmitExamAsync(..)
  +SendHeartbeatAsync(..)
  +SendMonitoringEventAsync(..)
  +SendEventBatchAsync(..)
  +UploadCaptureAsync(..)
}

class ExamsController <<Backend_API: api/exams>> #FFF6E0 {
  +StartStudentExam()  [student/start]
  +StartSession(id)  [{id}/start-session, practice]
  +SaveAnswer(sessionId, req)  [sessions/{sessionId}/save-answer]
  +Submit(sessionId)  [sessions/{sessionId}/submit]
}
class MonitoringController <<Backend_API: api/monitoring>> #FFF6E0 {
  +Heartbeat(..)  [heartbeat]
  +PushEvent(..)  [event]
  +PushEventBatch(..)  [events/batch]
  +UploadScreenshot(..)  [screenshot]
}

LockdownCoordinator ..> LiveMonitoringService : ReportViolation\n(violationSink)
LockdownCoordinator --> ApiClient : fallback
LiveMonitoringService *-right- WebcamMonitorService
WebcamMonitorService ..> WebcamVision
LiveMonitoringService --> ApiClient
ReadinessCheckService --> ApiClient : ProbeHealthAsync\n(GET api/health)

ApiClient ..> ExamsController : HTTPS
ApiClient ..> MonitoringController : HTTPS

skinparam legendFontSize 11
legend bottom right
  <back:#E8F0FB>      </back>  Student<U+005F>Desktop<U+005F>App (WPF client)
  <back:#FFF6E0>      </back>  Backend<U+005F>API (server side, see part 3)
endlegend
@enduml
